tramarines\" class=\"entity-link\">Ultramarines</a> are a Space Marine Chapter.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Contains:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/warhammer-40k/imperium-of-man/space-marines/blood-angels\" class=\"entity-link\">Blood Angels</a>\n            — The <a href=\"/warhammer-40k/imperium-of-man/space-marines/blood-angels\" class=\"entity-link\">Blood Angels</a> are a Space Marine Chapter.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Member Of:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/warhammer-40k/imperium-of-man\" class=\"entity-link\">Imperium of Man</a>\n            — Space Marines defend the Imperium.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/warhammer-40k/warp/eye-of-terror\" class=\"entity-link\">Eye of Terror</a>\n            — <a href=\"/warhammer-40k/warp/eye-of-terror\" class=\"entity-link\">Eye of Terror</a> is connected to Space Marines through shared lore.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/warhammer-40k/emperor-of-mankind\" class=\"entity-link\">Emperor of Mankind</a>\n            — <a href=\"/warhammer-40k/emperor-of-mankind\" class=\"entity-link\">Emperor of Mankind</a> is connected to Space Marines through shared lore.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/warhammer-40k/chaos/black-legion\" class=\"entity-link\">Black Legion</a>\n            — <a href=\"/warhammer-40k/chaos/black-legion\" class=\"entity-link\">Black Legion</a> is connected to Space Marines through shared lore.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/warhammer-40k/primarchs/roboute-guilliman\" class=\"entity-link\">Roboute Guilliman</a>\n            — <a href=\"/warhammer-40k/primarchs/roboute-guilliman\" class=\"entity-link\">Roboute Guilliman</a> is connected to Space Marines through shared lore.\n        </li>\n    </ul>